on-delay: 0.206452s;"><strong>Active Avoidance:</strong> A key sign of phob=
ia is a desperate attempt to escape. This includes hiding in enclosed space=
s (bathrooms, closets, under furniture), destructive scratching at doors an=
d windows, or trying to bolt from the house.</p></li></ul><h4 style=3D"text=
