reFade fadeIn" style=3D"white-space: pre-wrap; transition-timing-function: =
ease; transition-duration: 0.8s; transition-delay: 0.212903s;">A robust pla=
n addresses the issue from multiple angles simultaneously.</p><p class=3D"p=
reFade fadeIn" style=3D"white-space: pre-wrap; transition-timing-function: =
ease; transition-duration: 0.8s; transition-delay: 0.216129s;"><span class=
=3D"sqsrte-text-color--accent"><strong>1. Environmental Management: Creatin=
g a Sanctuary</strong></span></p><p class=3D"preFade fadeIn" style=3D"white=
-space: pre-wrap; transition-timing-function: ease; transition-duration: 0.=
8s; transition-delay: 0.219355s;">The first step is to control your dog's i=
mmediate environment to reduce sensory input.</p><ul data-rte-list=3D"defau=
lt"><li><p class=3D"preFade fadeIn" style=3D"white-space: pre-wrap; transit=
ion-timing-function: ease; transition-duration: 0.8s; transition-delay: 0.2=
22581s;"><strong>Build a "Safe Den":</strong> Long before the event, cultiv=
ate a safe space. This could be a crate covered with heavy blankets, a clos=
et with their bed inside, or a windowless bathroom. This plays into their n=
atural denning instinct to seek shelter. Encourage them to use this space w=
ith high-value treats and toys, so they build a positive association with i=
t. <strong>Crucially, never force them into or out of their den.</strong></=
p></li></ul><ul data-rte-list=3D"default"><li><p class=3D"preFade fadeIn" s=
tyle=3D"white-space: pre-wrap; transition-timing-function: ease; transition=
-duration: 0.8s; transition-delay: 0.225806s;"><strong>Mask the Threat:</st=
rong> Drown out the external noise. Close all windows and draw heavy curtai=
ns to block both sound and light flashes. Use sound masking tools like a wh=
ite noise machine or play calming music. Studies have shown that classical =
music can have a soothing effect on kenneled dogs.</p></li></ul><p class=3D=
"preFade fadeIn" style=3D"white-space: pre-wrap; transition-timing-function=
: ease; transition-duration: 0.8s; transition-delay: 0.229032s;"><span clas=
