nsition-delay: 0.235484s;"><strong>Pheromone Therapy:</strong> Products lik=
e Adaptil release a synthetic version of the Dog Appeasing Pheromone (DAP),=
 which a mother dog secretes to calm her puppies. Using a diffuser can help=
