delay: 0.251613s;"><strong>Pressure Wraps:</strong> Garments like the Thund=
ershirt apply gentle, constant pressure, which can have a calming effect on=
 the nervous system for some dogs, similar to swaddling an infant. Observe =
your dog closely; if they appear more frozen than calm, it may not be the r=
ight tool for them.</p></li></ul><ul data-rte-list=3D"default"><li><p class=
=3D"preFade fadeIn" style=3D"white-space: pre-wrap; transition-timing-funct=
ion: ease; transition-duration: 0.8s; transition-delay: 0.254839s;"><strong=
>Veterinary Intervention:</strong> For dogs with severe phobias, prescripti=
