le=3D"white-space: pre-wrap; transition-timing-function: ease; transition-d=
uration: 0.8s; transition-delay: 0.374194s;">Never force your pet toward th=
e trigger=E2=80=94respect their pace</p></li><li><p class=3D"preFade fadeIn=
" style=3D"white-space: pre-wrap; transition-timing-function: ease; transit=
ion-duration: 0.8s; transition-delay: 0.377419s;">It is highly recommended =
to undertake DSCC under the guidance of a certified veterinary behaviorist =
or a qualified positive reinforcement trainer.</p></li></ul><p class=3D"pre=
Fade fadeIn" style=3D"white-space: pre-wrap; transition-timing-function: ea=
se; transition-duration: 0.8s; transition-delay: 0.380645s;">Incorrect appl=
ication can worsen anxiety. When in doubt, consult a <strong>R+</strong> <s=
trong>qualified behaviourist</strong>.</p><p class=3D"preFade fadeIn" style=
=3D"white-space: pre-wrap; transition-timing-function: ease; transition-dur=
ation: 0.8s; transition-delay: 0.383871s;">Desensitisation and countercondi=
tioning can dramatically improve your pet=E2=80=99s quality of life, buildi=
ng confidence and reducing stress. With patience, observation, and positive=
